# The STAIRS of a built Walkway piece next to a plain road piece: a board with side beams and treads, from the deck's
# height at one cell edge to the ground at the other. The mesh and the collider are FLAT (the walk surface is y = 0,
# +Z goes down, 2.83 m long): the game spawns the entity at the middle of the slope, turned toward the road and
# pitched to the slope (StructureSystem::updateWalkway). The treads are render-only: the collider is a smooth board.
Prefab gameWalkwayStairs
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer walkway
		Node WalkwayStairs
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.5 0.36 0.2
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 0.98 0.1 1.414
		Offset 0 -0.1 0
